.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt KLDLOAD-MGMT 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm kldload-mgmt
.Nd a shell with the command reference printed above its prompt
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl h | -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Prints
.Xr kldload-help 8 Ns 's
overview, then starts a shell in which
.Ql help
shows it again.
The operator console's
.Ql help
opens it.
Everything done here can be done in any shell.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print the header comment and exit 0.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr kldload-console 8 ,
.Xr kldload-help 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An kldload Aq Mt anthony@kldload.com
